{"title":"2024 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_(Goes_through_the_full_thought_process)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle (Goes through the full thought process)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks_Now\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks_Now</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(Simple_and_Fast)_by_Parshwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (Simple and Fast) by Parshwa</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(easy_to_digest)_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (easy to digest) by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_[🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥]\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Intersigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Intersigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">20</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When Yunji added all the integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, she mistakenly left out a number. Her incorrect sum turned out to be a square number. What number did Yunji leave out?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/180a6671b054460660450fd54cfede93ceb6cf11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 5\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 6\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 7\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 8\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"355\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>basically the one below i guess just explained a lil different. so yes we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. then we see what’s the closet square, which is obviously <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (i hope we have our squares memorized by now) and then we do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e51224f17ec28d20390a6d68e5561436015394c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" />.\n~pereena\n</p><p>Adding numbers 1 through 9 gives us 45. This was her expected sum, but what she got was a perfect square. Since she got that perfect square sum by forgetting a number, that sum is less than 45. The square number right under 45 is 36. So 45 - 36 = 9. So the solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e51224f17ec28d20390a6d68e5561436015394c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~That_One_Dude\n~Sakura_kitty (minor latex edit)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bSPWqeNO11M?si=HIzlxPjMfvGM5lxR\">https://youtu.be/bSPWqeNO11M?si=HIzlxPjMfvGM5lxR</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3MtJRXIIxyM\">https://youtu.be/3MtJRXIIxyM</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Detailed_Explanation.29_.F0.9F.9A.80.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.93.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\">Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Youtube Link ⬇️\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5mCSOiqX8sA\">https://youtu.be/5mCSOiqX8sA</a>\n</p><p>~ ChillGuyDoesMath&#160;:)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_.28Goes_through_the_full_thought_process.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_(Goes_through_the_full_thought_process)\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle (Goes through the full thought process)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle (Goes through the full thought process)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/dMX5_MXVkYs\">https://youtu.be/dMX5_MXVkYs</a>\n</p><p>~mr_mathman\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks_Now\">Video by MathTalks_Now</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks_Now\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crn37TRMLv4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crn37TRMLv4</a>\n</p><p>-rc1219\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=tzbzeCdEfXqROciK&amp;t=907\">https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=tzbzeCdEfXqROciK&amp;t=907</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=bxVKQiul4AjzVUgC&amp;t=331\">https://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=bxVKQiul4AjzVUgC&amp;t=331</a>\n</p><p>~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Simple_and_Fast.29_by_Parshwa\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Simple_and_Fast)_by_Parshwa\">Video Solution 1 (Simple and Fast) by Parshwa</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Simple and Fast) by Parshwa\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Qrf4GTDjjXs\">https://youtu.be/Qrf4GTDjjXs</a>\n